ne","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.祕訣：呼籲句、結論段重點","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)第五段寫道，如果遭遇跟騷，你有權明確表達拒絕，甚至報警。末段呼籲：「如果真心喜歡，就從尊重開始！」","n":52,"ssz":"...................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)作者想讓我知道：","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"喜歡一個人要不顧一切、以浪漫方式追求","n":18,"ssz":"...1..1..1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"追求異性時，要尊重對方的意願，避免觸法","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遭遇騷擾時，可以明確拒絕並尋求協助","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、挑戰題：\n再讀一個短文，看看你是否可以讀出作者的主要觀點和寫作目的。","n":36,"ssz":"..........1...................1...2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、挑戰題：","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"再讀一個短文，看看你是否可以讀出作者的主要觀點和寫作目的。","n":29,"ssz":"...1...................1...2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"別讓紙吸管成為下一個塑膠袋","n":13,"ssz":".........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為響應減塑，許多飲料店改用紙吸管。但不少消費者已養成用完即丟的習慣，因此常一次拿幾支吸管，以備不時之需。環保團體調查發現，一些觀光區紙吸管一週的垃圾量竟高於過去使用塑膠吸管時期。此外，多數紙吸管難以有效回收處理，最終仍將送進焚化爐。減塑真正該做的是「少用一次性吸管」，而非僅將材質從塑膠換成紙。下次點飲料前，先問自己──我真的需要吸管嗎？","n":169,"ssz":"..1.....................................................1....2.......2..................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❶確認焦點\n1.問自己：這篇在談「哪個主題」？","n":25,"ssz":"....................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.問自己：這篇在談「哪個主題」？","n":17,"ssz":"............1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.這篇文章主要關注哪個主題？（請打勾，單選）","n":23,"ssz":"...........1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"塑膠袋污染","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一次性吸管帶來的環境問題","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❷推論作者觀點\n1.問自己：作者對這個主題有什麼看法？支持、反對？","n":35,"ssz":"....................1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❷推論作者觀點","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.問自己：作者對這個主題有什麼看法？支持、反對？","n":25,"ssz":"..........1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.根據標題與短文內容，作者主要的看法為何？（請打勾，單選）","n":30,"ssz":"...................1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紙吸管能解決塑膠污染問題","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"應該減少使用一次性吸管，而非僅更換材質","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"步驟❸找支持證據\n1.問自己：作者用什麼說服我？","n":24,"ssz":"....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.問自己：作者用什麼說服我？","n":15,"ssz":"...........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.文中哪兩項資訊用來支持作者觀點？（請打勾，複選）","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"調查發現某些景點的紙吸管垃圾量甚至比塑膠吸管更多","n":24,"ssz":"1......................."